      "id": "variante-ascari",
      "name": "Variante Ascari",
      "story": "Once the Curva del Vialone or del Platano, it was named in 1955 for Alberto Ascari, twice world champion, who was killed here that May testing a Ferrari sports car. It became the Variante Ascari when the chicane was built in 1972.",
